        IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
        PROGRAM-ID. AUNCIENT-LEED-PLATINUM-USDA-THEOREMS-46-50.
        ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
        DATA DIVISION.
        WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
        01  WS-LEED-PLATINUM-STATE.
            05  WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR            PIC 9(05) VALUE 00256.
            05  WS-TH46-EA-ENERGY-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH47-IEQ-COMFORT-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH48-IEQ-CO2-IAQ-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH49-WE-WATER-EFF-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH50-MR-LCA-CARBON-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-LEED-PROOF-WITNESS       PIC 9(01) VALUE 0.
        PROCEDURE DIVISION.
        0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
            PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-LEED-PLATINUM.
            GOBACK.
        1000-EVALUATE-LEED-PLATINUM.
            IF WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR = 00256 AND
               WS-TH46-EA-ENERGY-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH47-IEQ-COMFORT-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH48-IEQ-CO2-IAQ-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH49-WE-WATER-EFF-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH50-MR-LCA-CARBON-OK = 1
                MOVE 1 TO WS-LEED-PROOF-WITNESS
            ELSE
                MOVE 0 TO WS-LEED-PROOF-WITNESS.
